{
 "content": [
  {
   "eventName": "HOST/DictationVO/55361",
   "id": "600000",
   "text": [
    "Dear Bushiroad,",
    "I am writing about your OverTriggers.",
    "My opponent drive checked one when I was grade 2",
    "and I lost immediately without getting to play.",
    "If you do not remove them from the game.",
    "I will kindly invite you to visit my hotel.",
    "So we can have SO MUCH FUN together.",
    "Best Regards."
   ]
  },
  {
   "eventName": "HOST/DictationVO/55359",
   "id": "600001",
   "text": [
    "Dear Card Capital,",
    "I understand your store manager is a cat.",
    "I have no problem with this.",
    "But the cat sold me a booster box",
    "and every card inside was a common.",
    "I would like a refund in fish.",
    "If not, I will open my own card shop.",
    "It will have a very comfortable basement."
   ]
  },
  {
   "eventName": "HOST/DictationVO/55360",
   "id": "600002",
   "text": [
    "Dear Toshiki Kai,",
    "You keep announcing the final turn.",
    "Then the game keeps going.",
    "At my hotel, the final turn is final.",
    "Please come and see for yourself.",
    "Bring your Dragonic Overlord.",
    "We have a fireplace that should fit him."
   ]
  },
  {
   "eventName": "HOST/DictationVO/55829",
   "id": "600003",
   "text": [
    "Dear Aichi Sendou,",
    "You told everyone to imagine.",
    "So I imagined my guests winning.",
    "It was the funniest thing I have ever pictured.",
    "Please stop giving them hope.",
    "It only makes the screaming louder.",
    "Yours truly, the front desk."
   ]
  },
  {
   "eventName": "HOST/DictationVO/55830",
   "id": "600004",
   "text": [
    "Dear Guests,",
    "Someone keeps checking heal triggers.",
    "I deal the sixth damage,",
    "and a nurse angel fixes everything.",
    "This is a hotel, not a hospital.",
    "Any angels found in the lobby",
    "will be asked to check out.",
    "Permanently."
   ]
  },
  {
   "eventName": "HOST/DictationVO/55831",
   "id": "600005",
   "text": [
    "Dear Link Joker,",
    "Thank you for staying at my hotel.",
    "Sadly, you locked every door in the building.",
    "I have been stuck behind my desk for three days.",
    "Please unlock everything at once.",
    "The guests have started to like you.",
    "That will not do."
   ]
  },
  {
   "eventName": "HOST/DictationVO/55832",
   "id": "600006",
   "text": [
    "Dear Perfect Guard,",
    "You are the reason my guests survive.",
    "I attack with all my power,",
    "and you simply say no.",
    "One card from the hand is too cheap.",
    "From now on, the price is one soul.",
    "I am collecting."
   ]
  }
 ]
}
